title: mf gui selected
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Scripting the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Print the checked metarecords' UUIDs, one per line (nothing checked = no output)

Prints the uuids of the metarecords checked in the focused workspace, one per line — nothing, with exit 0, when none is checked ([[Cross-panel selection]], [[A query is the scope]]). The files checked without a metarecord are not among them: the workspace variable `selected_untracked_paths` holds those (`GET /gui/workspaces/:id/vars/selected_untracked_paths`, [[GUI scripting endpoints]]).
